=2 Walkthrough
* After finishing all of the cutscenes after {p:Dawn|Promathia Mission 8-4} including Blueblade Fell, walk towards the Palace in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} to begin the cutscene.
* Examine the Dilapidated Gate in {z:Misareaux Coast} (F-7) for a cutscene.
** The Unity Warp npc-option "content level 122" > {z:Misareaux Coast} puts you right in front of this gate.
* Head to the **Unstable Displacement** in the northwest section of {p:Riverne - Site #B01|Riverne - Site B01} (E-7) for a cutscene.
** The Unstable Displacement will not turn green until you are standing almost directly on top of it.
** (Fastest Route) Use {p:Home Point} > {p:Riverne - Site #B01|Riverne - Site B01}.
*** If using the {p:Home Point} go northeast to the normal Spatial Displacement in order to reach the island that has the green displacement.
** (Optional) - You can take the long way from the Dilapidated Gate in {z:Misareaux Coast} (F-7) to get there using {i:Giant Scale|Giant Scale|1691} along the way to reach (E-7).
* Click the green **Unstable Displacement** again after the cutscene to enter the BC **Storms of Fate** with {p:Bahamut}.
* Defeat Bahamut for another cutscene.
* Return to the Palace in Ru'Lude Gardens for a cutscene that completes the quest.

